10a4|a|Existing in idea or thought; conceptional; intellectual; mental; as, ideal knowledge. ; Reaching an imaginary standard of excellence; fit for a model; faultless; as, ideal beauty. ; Existing in fancy or imagination only; visionary; unreal. ; Teaching the doctrine of idealism; as, the ideal theory or philosophy. ; Imaginary.	j:2bcg,56,11;1xs2,50,17;ak3,40,1;anh,39,2;1wqe,35,6;rch,27,4;2323,22,6;2324,22,1;28od,21,1;1n1i,6,6;b92,6,2;2abm,6,3~1xs2,50,17;2bcg,56,11;1n1i,6,6;2323,22,6;1wqe,35,6;rch,27,4;2abm,6,3;b92,6,2;anh,39,2;28od,21,1;ak3,40,1;2324,22,1
